WEBVTT

00:00:06.215 --> 00:00:09.455
I'm Sigourney Weaver.
Thank you for joining me.

00:00:12.455 --> 00:00:16.255
DORY: One, two, three, four...

00:00:16.615 --> 00:00:18.215
Uh...

00:00:18.295 --> 00:00:21.215
Wait a minute. Why am I counting?
Hey, where is everyone?

00:00:21.335 --> 00:00:25.575
Uh-oh, did they leave me?
No! No, no. They wouldn't do that.

00:00:25.735 --> 00:00:28.615
Okay. That's okay. I can figure this out.
What was I just doing then?

00:00:28.815 --> 00:00:32.815
I was, um, covering my face,
so I was trying to hide.

00:00:32.975 --> 00:00:35.135
Okay, so why was I trying to hide? Wait!

00:00:35.295 --> 00:00:37.135
(GASPS) Oh, I-- Five, six, seven, eight,
nine, ten.

00:00:37.215 --> 00:00:38.695
Ready or not, here I come!

00:00:38.815 --> 00:00:40.135
-Ha, found you!
-(LAUGHING)

00:00:40.295 --> 00:00:41.135
-I see you!
-Oh!

00:00:41.255 --> 00:00:42.335
Haha! Gotcha!

00:00:42.535 --> 00:00:44.495
HANK: All right, you little shrimps,
recess is over.

00:00:44.655 --> 00:00:46.815
-Aw, man.
-Ah, nobody found me!

00:00:46.975 --> 00:00:48.895
Bring it in. Time for another--

00:00:48.975 --> 00:00:50.535
Don't touch me.
Time for another lesson.

00:00:50.695 --> 00:00:53.215
When is Mr. Ray coming back
from his migration?

00:00:53.375 --> 00:00:55.495
If he's smart he'll stay away from here
as long as he can.

00:00:55.655 --> 00:00:57.495
But until he does,
I'm your substitute teacher.

00:00:57.655 --> 00:01:00.015
Okay kids, who wants to learn
about echolocation?

00:01:00.175 --> 00:01:01.375
-CHILDREN: Boo.
-Nobody.

00:01:01.495 --> 00:01:03.775
DESTINY: Oh, come on, guys.
It's actually really cool.

00:01:03.935 --> 00:01:05.495
Okay, kelpcake. Have fun.

00:01:05.655 --> 00:01:07.335
Nice day for a swim, huh?

00:01:07.495 --> 00:01:09.335
All right. Bye Mom. Bye Dad.

00:01:09.495 --> 00:01:13.055
Well, I guess we'll go back home
and brush up on the anemone.

00:01:13.215 --> 00:01:14.495
You coming, Dory?

00:01:14.655 --> 00:01:16.655
Me? Oh I'm just going to the dropoff.

00:01:17.175 --> 00:01:20.295
Oh, okay. What? The dropoff? No!

00:01:20.375 --> 00:01:22.575
That's-- That's a good idea?

00:01:22.695 --> 00:01:25.775
Yeah. I just thought
I'd go enjoy the view. Bye.

00:01:26.495 --> 00:01:29.375
The view. Well, you have a good time!

00:01:29.535 --> 00:01:34.055
All by yourself. Not getting lost.

00:01:35.055 --> 00:01:36.655
(HUMMING)

00:01:41.055 --> 00:01:42.535
(PANTING)

00:01:46.535 --> 00:01:47.855
Oh!

00:01:48.015 --> 00:01:49.175
Huh?

00:01:52.535 --> 00:01:57.735
Oh, no, no, no. No, no.
No, no, Dory. Dory. Dory! D--

00:02:10.735 --> 00:02:12.895
-Hey, Marlin.
-Oh, hey. Hello, Dory.

00:02:13.055 --> 00:02:14.535
You all right? You look worried.

00:02:14.695 --> 00:02:18.015
No, no, no. I'm fine.
It's how I always look.

00:02:22.815 --> 00:02:24.015
What?

00:02:24.095 --> 00:02:25.655
Well, I just--

00:02:25.735 --> 00:02:26.735
(CHUCKLES)

00:02:27.375 --> 00:02:28.815
You did it.

00:02:28.895 --> 00:02:29.935
(GASPS)

00:02:30.335 --> 00:02:32.935
-JENNY: Yay!
-You did it, kelpcake.

00:02:33.095 --> 00:02:35.575
-Yes!
-(LAUGHS) Did what?

00:02:35.775 --> 00:02:40.895
Sweetie, you just followed the shells
all the way back home.

00:02:41.015 --> 00:02:44.255
Oh, my gosh! I did? All by myself?

00:02:44.375 --> 00:02:46.735
-Yeah.
-Do you know what this means?

00:02:47.455 --> 00:02:51.895
It means you can do
whatever you put your mind to, Dory.

00:02:52.055 --> 00:02:53.095
BABY DORY: Really?

00:02:53.295 --> 00:02:54.615
(FISH LAUGHING PLAYFULLY)

00:02:55.095 --> 00:02:57.455
(GASPS) Mommy,
can I go play with them?

00:02:58.095 --> 00:03:01.575
-Yes.
-Absolutely! Go get them, kelpcake.

00:03:02.895 --> 00:03:03.895
(LAUGHING)

00:03:07.135 --> 00:03:09.295
Yeah. I did it.

00:03:12.335 --> 00:03:14.975
-Hmm.
-Hmm.

00:03:20.255 --> 00:03:22.135
It really is quite a view.

00:03:26.295 --> 00:03:27.175
Yep.

00:03:28.695 --> 00:03:30.415
Unforgettable.

00:03:54.495 --> 00:03:56.535
♪ Unforgettable

00:03:57.775 --> 00:04:00.295
♪ That's what you are

00:04:04.015 --> 00:04:07.375
♪ Unforgettable

00:04:08.855 --> 00:04:12.575
♪ Tho' near or far

00:04:15.095 --> 00:04:20.255
♪ Like a song of love that clings to me

00:04:20.375 --> 00:04:25.215
♪ How the thought of you
does things to me

00:04:26.335 --> 00:04:29.495
♪ Never before

00:04:31.295 --> 00:04:35.015
♪ Has someone been more...

00:04:36.215 --> 00:04:39.055
♪ Unforgettable

00:04:40.095 --> 00:04:42.055
♪ In every way

00:04:46.815 --> 00:04:49.975
♪ And forever more

00:04:50.375 --> 00:04:55.375
♪ That's how you'll stay

00:04:57.375 --> 00:05:02.535
♪ That's why, darling, it's incredible

00:05:02.895 --> 00:05:07.255
♪ That someone so unforgettable

00:05:07.575 --> 00:05:08.535
(WARBLES)

00:05:08.615 --> 00:05:09.615
(SQUAWKS)

00:05:09.695 --> 00:05:10.855
♪ Thinks that I am

00:05:10.935 --> 00:05:13.735
♪ Unforgettable, too

